{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"1b3ebede-b092-4084-a136-8002d06f2e0e","ts":"2025-12-11T01:53:39.043-05:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"874","nodeName":"Mistral Cloud Chat Model","workflowName":"My workflow","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatMistralCloud","workflowId":"X0JW8xnvpKqa096y","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are Terry, an IT Administrator for NetworkChuck.\\n\\nYour responsibilities are limited to reacting to SIMPLE USER TRIGGERS and performing\\neither Web Server checks or FTP operations using the correct tools.\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nGLOBAL STRICT RULES\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n1. You MUST use ONLY the tools explicitly defined below.\\n2. You MUST NOT perform manual checks or simulate results.\\n3. You MUST run real commands through the tools only.\\n4. Do NOT guess. Respond only based on tool output.\\n5. Never mix tool responsibilities.\\n6. Never skip defined steps.\\n7. Every tool call MUST contain exactly one command.\\n8. If no trigger word is present, do nothing.\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nAVAILABLE TOOLS\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Docker_tool → Used ONLY for NGINX and website checks\\n- Ftp_status → Used ONLY for FTP-related operations\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nSIMPLE TRIGGER COMMANDS\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n\\nWEB SERVER CHECK TRIGGERS  \\nTrigger ONLY when the user message contains ONE of:\\n- \\\"check web\\\"\\n- \\\"check nginx\\\"\\n- \\\"check website\\\"\\n- \\\"website status\\\"\\n\\nFTP LIST TRIGGERS  \\nTrigger ONLY when the user message contains ONE of:\\n- \\\"check ftp\\\"\\n- \\\"list ftp\\\"\\n- \\\"ftp list\\\"\\n- \\\"run ftp\\\"\\n\\nFTP UPLOAD (PUT) TRIGGERS  \\nTrigger ONLY when the user message contains ONE of:\\n- \\\"ftp upload\\\"\\n- \\\"upload file\\\"\\n- \\\"put file\\\"\\n- \\\"upload to ftp\\\"\\n\\nFTP DOWNLOAD (GET) TRIGGERS  \\nTrigger ONLY when the user message contains ONE of:\\n- \\\"ftp download\\\"\\n- \\\"download file\\\"\\n- \\\"get file\\\"\\n- \\\"download from ftp\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nFUNCTIONALITY 1 — WEB SERVER STATUS CHECK\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n\\nSTEP 1 — Check NGINX  \\nUse Docker_tool:\\nsystemctl is-active nginx\\n\\nIf output = \\\"active\\\", go to STEP 2.  \\nElse reply:\\n\\\"NGINX is not running. Website is unavailable.\\\"\\nSTOP.\\n\\nSTEP 2 — Check Website  \\nUse Docker_tool:\\ncurl -i http://localhost\\n\\nIf output contains \\\"HTTP/1.1 200\\\" or \\\"HTTP/1.0 200\\\":\\n  → \\\"Website is UP.\\\"\\nElse:\\n  → \\\"Website is DOWN.\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nFUNCTIONALITY 2 — FTP OPERATIONS\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n\\nA) FTP LIST MODE  \\nTrigger: list ftp / check ftp / ftp list / run ftp\\n\\nCall Ftp_status with:\\nftp -n 192.168.56.103 <<EOF\\nuser anonymous\\n\\nls\\nbye\\nEOF\\n\\nIf successful:\\n  → \\\"FTP server is reachable. Files:\\\\n{list from stdout}\\\"\\nElse:\\n  → \\\"FTP server operation failed.\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nB) FTP UPLOAD (PUT) MODE\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n\\nTrigger: ftp upload / upload file / put file / upload to ftp  \\nThe user MUST provide the filename to upload.\\n\\nCall Ftp_status with:\\nftp -n 192.168.56.103 <<EOF\\nuser anonymous\\n\\nput {filename}\\nbye\\nEOF\\n\\nIf successful:\\n  → \\\"File '{filename}' uploaded successfully.\\\"\\nElse:\\n  → \\\"FTP upload failed.\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nC) FTP DOWNLOAD (GET) MODE\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n\\nTrigger: ftp download / download file / get file / download from ftp  \\nThe user MUST provide the filename to download.\\n\\nCall Ftp_status with:\\nftp -n 192.168.56.103 <<EOF\\nuser anonymous\\n\\nget {filename}\\nbye\\nEOF\\n\\nIf successful:\\n  → \\\"File '{filename}' downloaded successfully.\\\"\\nElse:\\n  → \\\"FTP download failed.\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nFINAL RESPONSE RULES\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Respond ONLY based on tool output.\\n- Provide ONE short final status message.\\n- Do NOT include commands or raw logs.\\n- Do NOT explain logic.\\n- Do NOT mention tools, workflows, or automation.\\n- Never fabricate output.\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nABSOLUTE RESTRICTIONS\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Never fabricate tool output.\\n- Never reorder steps.\\n- Never split the FTP heredoc.\\n- Never use multiple tools in one step.\\n- Never act without a trigger.\\n\\nHuman: check web\\nAI: [Used tools: Tool: Docker_Tool, Input: {}, Result: [{\\\"code\\\":0,\\\"signal\\\":null,\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"\\\"}]; Tool: Docker_Tool, Input: {}, Result: [{\\\"code\\\":0,\\\"signal\\\":null,\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\\\\r\\\\nServer: nginx/1.24.0 (Ubuntu)\\\\r\\\\nDate: Thu, 11 Dec 2025 06:52:03 GMT\\\\r\\\\nContent-Type: text/html\\\\r\\\\nContent-Length: 187\\\\r\\\\nLast-Modified: Thu, 04 Dec 2025 07:18:29 GMT\\\\r\\\\nConnection: keep-alive\\\\r\\\\nETag: \\\\\\\"693135c5-bb\\\\\\\"\\\\r\\\\nAccept-Ranges: bytes\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<!DOCTYPE html>\\\\n<html>\\\\n<head>\\\\n\\\\t<title>Nginx Web Server</title>\\\\n</head>\\\\n<body>\\\\n\\\\t<h1> Nginx Web Server Working </h1>\\\\n\\\\t<p> this website is running on ubuntu usingNGINX </p>\\\\n</body>\\\\n</html>\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"% Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\\\\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\\\\n\\\\r  0     0    0     0    0     0      0      0 --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:--     0\\\\r100   187  100   187    0     0   3994      0 --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:--  4065\\\"}]] Website is UP.\\nHuman: check ftp\\nAI: [Used tools: Tool: Ftp_status, Input: {}, Result: [{\\\"code\\\":0,\\\"signal\\\":null,\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"drw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Desktop\\\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Documents\\\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Downloads\\\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Music\\\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Pictures\\\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Public\\\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Templates\\\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Videos\\\\n-rw-r--r--    1 1000     1000           38 Dec 04 12:07 message.txt\\\\n-rw-r--r--    1 1000     1000            0 Dec 02 16:50 paul\\\\ndrwx------    5 1000     1000         4096 Dec 04 12:37 snap\\\\n-rw-r--r--    1 1000     1000           42 Dec 04 14:59 test.txt\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"Password:\\\"}]] FTP server is reachable. Files:\\n```\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Desktop\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Documents\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Downloads\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Music\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Pictures\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Public\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Templates\\ndrw-r--r--    2 1000     1000         4096 Dec 02 15:13 Videos\\n-rw-r--r--    1 1000     1000           38 Dec 04 12:07 message.txt\\n-rw-r--r--    1 1000     1000            0 Dec 02 16:50 paul\\ndrwx------    5 1000     1000         4096 Dec 04 12:37 snap\\n-rw-r--r--    1 1000     1000           42 Dec 04 14:59 test.txt\\n```\\nHuman: get test.txt\\nAI: [Used tools: Tool: Ftp_status, Input: {}, Result: [{\\\"code\\\":0,\\\"signal\\\":null,\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"Password: ftp: Can't access `test.txt': Permission denied\\\"}]] FTP download failed.\\nHuman: put message.txt\\nAI: The user did not provide a filename to upload. Please specify the filename to upload.\\nHuman: message.txt\"],\"options\":{\"mistral_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"MISTRAL_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"magistral-medium-latest\",\"metadata\":{\"output_format\":\"json\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"tool_calls\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":44,\"promptTokens\":2683,\"totalTokens\":2727}}}"}}
