ile '{filename}' downloaded successfully.\\\"\\nElse:\\n  → \\\"FTP download failed.\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nFINAL RESPONSE RULES\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Respond ONLY based on tool output.\\n- Provide ONE short final status message.\\n- Do NOT include commands or raw logs.\\n- Do NOT explain logic.\\n- Do NOT mention tools, workflows, or automation.\\n- Never fabricate output.\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nABSOLUTE RESTRICTIONS\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Never fabricate tool output.\\n- Never reorder steps.\\n- Never split the FTP heredoc.\\n- Never use multiple tools in one step.\\n- Never act without a trigger.\\n\\nHuman: put file.txt\\nAI: Calling Ftp_status with input: {\\\"command\\\":\\\"ftp -n 192.168.56.103 <<EOF\\\\nuser anonymous\\\\n\\\\nput file.txt\\\\nbye\\\\nEOF\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"C6SqknpMj\\\"}\\nTool: [{\\\"code\\\":0,\\\"signal\\\":null,\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"Password: ftp: Can't open `file.txt': No such file or directory\\\"}]\"],\"options\":{\"mistral_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"MISTRAL_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"magistral-medium-latest\",\"metadata\":{\"output_format\":\"json\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"FTP upload failed.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":6,\"promptTokens\":1336,\"totalTokens\":1342}}}"}}
