ile '{filename}' downloaded successfully.\\\"\\nElse:\\n  → \\\"FTP download failed.\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nFINAL RESPONSE RULES\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Respond ONLY based on tool output.\\n- Provide ONE short final status message.\\n- Do NOT include commands or raw logs.\\n- Do NOT explain logic.\\n- Do NOT mention tools, workflows, or automation.\\n- Never fabricate output.\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nABSOLUTE RESTRICTIONS\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Never fabricate tool output.\\n- Never reorder steps.\\n- Never split the FTP heredoc.\\n- Never use multiple tools in one step.\\n- Never act without a trigger.\\n\\nHuman: check ftp\\nAI: [Used tools: Tool: Ftp_status, Input: {}, Result: [{\\\"code\\\":0,\\\"signal\\\":null,\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"dr-xr-xr-x    2 123      124          4096 Dec 10 15:57 upload\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"Password:\\\"}]] FTP server is reachable. Files:\\ndr-xr-xr-x    2 123      124          4096 Dec 10 15:57 upload\\nHuman: chek ftp\"],\"options\":{\"mistral_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"MISTRAL_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"magistral-medium-latest\",\"metadata\":{\"output_format\":\"json\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1480,\"promptTokens\":1363,\"totalTokens\":2843}}}"}}
